# 草稿 tier 占位 — knowledge/draft/

Phase 2 plan 02-02: the draft tier is intentionally empty.

Drafts would carry tier=草稿 metadata (with [DRAFT] prefix in body)
when added by plan 02-03's Indexer. The compliance Skill cannot read
this tier (reads=[authority/**] only), so drafts are invisible to the
production verdict path.

The directory is kept in git (via this .gitkeep) so the four-tier
structure that D-07 + D2-12 mandate survives clones.